		(property "Note" "off while EN is low or +5V is below 2.4 V; limits the current to 1.2-1.4 A; nothing flows back from +5V_SW to +5V; /FAULT pulls the I_5VSW bit low on over-current (after 7.5 ms), over-temperature or reverse voltage.  7 V is the part's absolute maximum; in a short circuit it switches off and on thermally until Pico C lowers EN"
